          "description": "PURPOSE: Verify the PINE server (${EMU_NAME}) is reachable and responding. USAGE: Call once at session start before other tool calls. Issues PINE Version opcode (0x08) — doubles as liveness probe and emulator-version sniff. BEHAVIOR: No side effects. Bridge connects on demand — Unix socket at $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/${target.name}.sock.<slot> (Linux/macOS, with $TMPDIR/$/tmp fallback) or TCP to 127.0.0.1:<slot> (Windows, default slot ${target.defaultSlot}). 10-second timeout if the emulator isn",
